{
  "name": "genesis-voice-journaling",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "GENESIS Voice Journaling System - Elderly-friendly voice recording and memory preservation",
  "private": true,
  "dependencies": {
    "react": "^18.2.0",
    "react-dom": "^18.2.0",
    "firebase": "^10.7.1",
    "react-speech-recognition": "^3.10.0",
    "react-beautiful-dnd": "^13.1.1",
    "jszip": "^3.10.1"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/react": "^18.2.43",
    "@types/react-dom": "^18.2.17",
    "@vitejs/plugin-react": "^4.2.1",
    "vite": "^5.0.8"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "dev": "vite",
    "build": "vite build",
    "preview": "vite preview",
    "deploy": "firebase deploy"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=18.0.0"
  }
}

/* ============================================================================
   SETUP INSTRUCTIONS
   ============================================================================

   1. INSTALL DEPENDENCIES:
      npm install

   2. FIREBASE SETUP:
      - Create Firebase project at https://console.firebase.google.com
      - Enable Firestore Database
      - Enable Authentication (Email/Password or Anonymous)
      - Enable Cloud Functions (Blaze plan required for Gemini API)
      - Get your Firebase config

   3. CREATE firebase.js CONFIG FILE:
      
      File: src/firebase.js
      
      import { initializeApp } from 'firebase/app';
      import { getFirestore } from 'firebase/firestore';
      import { getAuth } from 'firebase/auth';
      import { getFunctions } from 'firebase/functions';

      const firebaseConfig = {
        apiKey: "YOUR_API_KEY",
        authDomain: "YOUR_AUTH_DOMAIN",
        projectId: "YOUR_PROJECT_ID",
        storageBucket: "YOUR_STORAGE_BUCKET",
        messagingSenderId: "YOUR_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID",
        appId: "YOUR_APP_ID"
      };

      const app = initializeApp(firebaseConfig);
      export const db = getFirestore(app);
      export const auth = getAuth(app);
      export const functions = getFunctions(app);

   4. DEPLOY FIREBASE FUNCTIONS:
      
      cd functions
      npm install
      
      Add to functions/package.json:
      {
        "dependencies": {
          "firebase-functions": "^4.5.0",
          "firebase-admin": "^12.0.0",
          "@google/generative-ai": "^0.1.3"
        }
      }
      
      Set environment variable for Gemini:
      firebase functions:config:set gemini.api_key="YOUR_GEMINI_API_KEY"
      
      Deploy:
      firebase deploy --only functions

   5. FIRESTORE SECURITY RULES:
      
      rules_version = '2';
      service cloud.firestore {
        match /databases/{database}/documents {
          match /users/{userId}/{document=**} {
            allow read, write: if request.auth != null && request.auth.uid == userId;
          }
        }
      }

   6. GET GEMINI API KEY:
      - Go to https://makersuite.google.com/app/apikey
      - Create new API key
      - Add to Firebase Functions config

   7. RUN DEVELOPMENT SERVER:
      npm run dev

   8. BUILD FOR PRODUCTION:
      npm run build

   9. DEPLOY TO FIREBASE HOSTING:
      firebase deploy

   ============================================================================

   BROWSER REQUIREMENTS:
   - Chrome 80+ (recommended for best speech recognition)
   - Edge 80+
   - Safari 14+ (limited speech recognition)
   - Firefox 90+ (no built-in speech recognition)

   MOBILE SUPPORT:
   - iOS Safari 14+
   - Chrome Android 80+

   ============================================================================

   FIRESTORE COLLECTIONS STRUCTURE:

   users/
     {userId}/
       voice_conversations/
         {conversationId}/
           - id: string
           - title: string
           - emoji: string
           - status: "active" | "deleted"
           - bullets: string[]
           - fullText: string
           - currentText: string
           - recordings: array[]
           - recordingCount: number
           - totalDuration: number
           - wordCount: number
           - createdAt: timestamp
           - lastEditedAt: timestamp
           - userNotes: string

       trash/
         {conversationId}/
           - id: string
           - originalData: object (full conversation)
           - deletedAt: timestamp
           - permanentDeleteAt: timestamp
           - daysRemaining: number

   ============================================================================

   FIREBASE FUNCTIONS:
   
   1. organizeAndInsertRecording - AI organizes each recording
   2. createBullets - Extracts bullet points
   3. createNarrative - Generates flowing story from bullets
   4. moveToTrash - Soft delete (15-day recovery)
   5. recoverFromTrash - Restore deleted conversation
   6. permanentlyDelete - Delete forever
   7. autoDeleteExpiredTrash - Scheduled daily cleanup
   8. exportToMarkdown - Generate .md file
   9. importFromMarkdown - Parse and create conversation
   10. generateAISummary - AI summary before submit

   ============================================================================

   ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES (Firebase Functions):
   
   GEMINI_API_KEY - Your Google Gemini API key
   
   Set with:
   firebase functions:config:set gemini.api_key="your-key-here"
   
   View with:
   firebase functions:config:get

   ============================================================================

   TESTING CHECKLIST:

   □ Speech recognition works (Chrome recommended)
   □ Recording → AI organization → Insert at cursor
   □ Bullet creation after each recording
   □ Drag-and-drop reordering works
   □ Voice commands for reordering ("move bullet 3 up 2")
   □ Text-to-speech playback works
   □ Playback highlighting shows current sentence
   □ Speed control (0.6x - 1.2x) works
   □ Delete → Trash (shows 15-day countdown)
   □ Recover from trash works
   □ Permanent delete after 15 days (manual or auto)
   □ Export single conversation (.md file)
   □ Export all conversations (.zip file)
   □ Import .md file creates new conversation
   □ Settings persist (localStorage)
   □ Text size changes (medium/large/xlarge)
   □ High contrast mode works
   □ Volume control works
   □ Mobile responsive (iPhone/Android)
   □ Offline capability (PWA optional)

   ============================================================================

   DEPLOYMENT CHECKLIST:

   □ Firebase project created
   □ Firestore enabled
   □ Authentication enabled
   □ Functions deployed
   □ Gemini API key set
   □ Security rules deployed
   □ Hosting configured
   □ Custom domain (optional)
   □ SSL certificate (automatic with Firebase)
   □ Analytics enabled (optional)

   ============================================================================

   COST ESTIMATES (Monthly, 100 active users):

   Firebase Firestore:
   - Read: 20K/user/month × 100 = 2M reads = $0.36
   - Write: 10K/user/month × 100 = 1M writes = $0.18
   - Storage: 1MB/user × 100 = 100MB = $0.02

   Firebase Functions:
   - Invocations: 100K/month = $0.40
   - Compute time: varies

   Gemini API:
   - Text processing: ~$5-10/month (depends on usage)

   Total: ~$10-15/month for 100 users
   
   Blaze Plan required (pay-as-you-go)

   ============================================================================

   SCALING CONSIDERATIONS:

   1,000 users: ~$50-80/month
   10,000 users: ~$300-500/month
   100,000 users: ~$2,000-4,000/month

   At scale, consider:
   - Caching AI responses
   - Rate limiting
   - Whisper API for better transcription
   - CDN for static assets
   - Load balancing

   ============================================================================

   SUPPORT & DOCUMENTATION:

   Firebase: https://firebase.google.com/docs
   Gemini: https://ai.google.dev/docs
   React Speech Recognition: https://github.com/JamesBrill/react-speech-recognition
   React Beautiful DnD: https://github.com/atlassian/react-beautiful-dnd

   ============================================================================
*/
